OL,3,GNEWSADonors turn out for annual charity
OL,4,ATinathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of an annual event in its
OL,7,F18th year accepting donations of tinned
OL,8,Ffood are hoping to match or break
OL,9,Fprevious records.
OL,11,FThe Jersey Tinathon for Shelter Trust
OL,12,FJersey takes place on Friday - last
OL,13,Fyear more than 13,000 tins were donated
OL,14,Fto the campaign.
OL,16,FOne donor helping support it, Judith
OL,17,FBennett, said: "I've been there, so I
OL,18,Fknow how they feel when you haven't got
OL,19,Fenough money to buy food."
