OL,3,GNEWSADonors turn out for annual charity
OL,4,ATinathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe brought more than 800 tins of food
OL,7,Ffrom Helvetia School to donate to the
OL,8,Fevent which helps provide food for
OL,9,Fpeople who are given accommodation by
OL,10,Fthe charity.
